round his  waist  the blood from that injury was found all  around the crime scene  this is him in a supermarket in the days  before the murders  buying the block of knives he'd go on to  use in the attack  and in a search of his mother's home  police uncovered a far  more sinister aspect to this crime  satanic symbols in his bedroom  and nearby a handwritten letter it was  a pact with the devil a promise to kill  six women every six months it was signed  in his own blood  in return he believed he'd win the  lottery  and have better luck with women  search teams even found receipts for  lottery tickets  purchased in the days after the murders  it's not known why the sisters were  targeted this is biba  and nicole in a local co-op buying food  and drink  shortly before heading to fryent park  tragically they may simply have been in  the wrong place  at the wrong time when hussein  discovered them  as horrific as this crime undoubtedly is  for the family and friends of the  sisters  there was the added trauma of being told  that two police officers  sent to guard the murder scene had  subsequently been charged  with taking unauthorized pictures of the  sisters  those two officers are due to appear at  the old bailly later this month  and now daniel hussein who lied  repeatedly to police  claiming he wasn't a killer but a victim  of a robbery attack himself  stands convicted of murder of killing  two sisters  who'd simply been relishing life and  celebrating their freedom from lockdown  mark white sky news
 

